      "type": "text",
      "value": "Solve the inequality 2y − 6 ≥ y + 4."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Think first: Subtract y from both sides to leave a single y term."
    },
    {
      "type": "asset",
      "storagePath": "assets/question_visuals/p059_q07.jpg",
      "altText": "Source visual for edmar-csec-p059-q07 from workbook page 59."
